Package: jetson-io-vc-mipi-profiles
Version: 32.7.6-1stage2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jetpack workspace contributors
Depends: nvidia-l4t-jetson-io (= 32.7.6-20241104234540), jetson-io-jammy-compat (= 32.7.6-1jammy1), python3, device-tree-compiler, dpkg
Description: Metadata-driven VC MIPI profile menu for NVIDIA Jetson-IO
 Adds a two-level VC MIPI profile selector without replacing Jetson-IO's
 board or pinmux compatibility backends.
